WEBVTT

00:00:01.932 --> 00:00:02.578
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.806 --> 00:00:05.920
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I’m sorry, I don’t know the answer.

00:00:07.872 --> 00:00:08.481
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:11.370
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> What are you going to wear to the party?

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:14.023
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:15.113 --> 00:00:17.633
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> The hotel has lovely views of the sea.

00:00:19.656 --> 00:00:20.216
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:21.263 --> 00:00:23.340
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I wore my new dress to the party.

00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:26.073
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.250
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Promise you’ll write to me.

00:00:30.228 --> 00:00:30.978
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:34.263
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Let’s meet tomorrow and have a chat.

00:00:36.274 --> 00:00:36.926
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:37.999 --> 00:00:39.913
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I really need to lose some weight.

00:00:41.872 --> 00:00:42.459
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:44.771
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> A table for one, please.